title: Baby1
---
Baby: This slope is for babies!
-> What is a baby doing on the mountain??
    Baby: I'm looking for stickers!
    -> Stickers?
        Baby: Yea! They hide a SECRET sticker on each slope.
        Baby: I haven't been able to find any yet...
        Baby: If you find them all, I'll give you a sticker from my collection.
        <<assign-quest allTheStickers>>
-> Aight, have fun I guess.
    Baby: Yay!!
